  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "ApiFeatures.Authentications.Sessions.MongoDatabases 9.2.0 adds a .NET 10 (net10.0) build and depends on ApiFeatures.Authentications.Sessions 9.2.0. Implements the new ISessionService.GetUnexpiredByUsernameAsync (sessions list) and stores the client metadata as Metadata.Custom (an array of { k, v } documents, any key allowed; older documents load with no metadata). The package now owns the BSON class maps of SessionEntity and SessionMetadata (a class map registered elsewhere makes the first use of SessionDatabaseContext fail with a TypeInitializationException) and no longer registers a process-wide Guid serializer (code that relied on it for its own Guid values must register its own). Recommended indexes (not created by the library): { Username: 1, CreatedTime: -1 } and unique { Key: 1 }. Rollback note: a 9.1 process that deserializes a 9.2-written session document (with Metadata.Custom) throws a FormatException for the unknown Custom element; 9.2 itself ignores unknown elements.",
